    "traits": {
      "value": [
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Hive Mind"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divination, primal)\n\nWereants operate with a shared hive intelligence.\n\nWhile within telepathic range of at least one other wereant, a wereant disciple gains a +2 circumstance bonus to initiative checks, Perception checks, and saving throws against mental effects. If one wereant is aware of a combatant, all members of the hive mind within telepathic range are aware of it."
            },
            "id": "d357981e-98e9-4d0b-9da5-3cdbda5d1a37",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:13:11.764363"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Insect Empathy"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(divination, primal)\n\nThe wereant can communicate with insects."
            },
            "id": "45c928ed-dde7-49e1-9fb1-e7641f13eebf",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:13:11.764363"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Curse of the Wereant"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(curse, necromancy, primal)\n\nThis curse affects only humanoids; On each full moon, the cursed creature must succeed at another Fortitude save or turn into a wereant until dawn. The creature is under the GM's control and goes on a rampage for half the night before falling unconscious until dawn.\n\nDC: 34\nSaving Throw: Fortitude"
            },
            "id": "6c64634b-a93e-4aa9-8301-120e503047c4",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:13:11.764363"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Moon Frenzy"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "(polymorph, primal, transmutation)\n\nWhen a full moon appears in the night sky, the wereant must enter hybrid form, can't Change Shape, becomes one size larger, increases their reach by 5 feet, and increases the damage of their mandibles Strike by 2. When the moon sets or the sun rises, the wereant returns to humanoid form and is fatigued for 2d4 hours."
            },
            "id": "536bcc84-f9a9-4695-82d4-ed99b59e8e04",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:13:11.764363"
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "resource_id": "monster_trait",
          "stats": {
            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Staggering Blow"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "A creature damaged by the wereant disciple's carapace fist Strike must succeed at a 35 Fortitude save or become stunned 1 (stunned 2 on a critical failure). If the Strike is a critical hit, a creature that fails the save is also paralyzed for 1 round."
            },
            "id": "9d1d3edb-8ede-4a88-a6ac-d4be4b65db59",
            "updated_at": {
              "value": "2026-04-15T14:13:11.764363"
            }
          }
        }
